                    Assistant Secretary Rubottom initialled this memorandum.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#co_d5-f2" n="2" xml:id="co_d5-f2-content">
                <p>Documentation relating to this subject is included in the compilation on United
                    States regional economic policy toward Latin America.</p>
